<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 10     July 09   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  276.280     276.640     247.020   11.85 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.550     309.470     306.830    0.89 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.480     156.960     158.970   -0.94 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.588	46.536	47.182   -1.26 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  466.000     466.900     419.180   11.17 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.820     139.400     141.685   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.116	16.119	16.185   -0.43 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  244.540     245.500     212.430   15.12 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.863	 1.859	 1.888   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.556	 1.581   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.055     188.880     183.135    3.78 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
